# =============================================================================
# Price_drop_one — Open Source Security & Build Ignore Rules
# 严禁将任何个人 Cookie、登录会话、飞书 Webhook 密钥或本地抓取缓存提交至仓库
# =============================================================================

# 1. 本地运行数据、私人登录态 Cookie、浏览器持久化 Profile 与 Webhook 配置（高敏核心）
.local-data/
local-data/
**/PriceDrop/
data/
cookies/
sessions/
browser-profiles/
profiles/
storage/
auth/
*.cookie
*.cookies
*cookie*.json
*session*.json
*feishu*.json
*webhook*.json
*token*.json
*secret*.json
jd.json
taobao.json
tmall.json
feishu.json
products.json

# 2. 环境变量与密钥文件
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.crt

# 3. 数据库与本地缓存
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.dump
.cache/
tmp/
temp/

# 4. Node.js 依赖与前后端构建产物
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.vite/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# 5. Playwright / 浏览器自动化截图与录制缓存
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
screenshots/
traces/

# 6. 操作系统、编辑器与日志文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
